  "prefLabel": "Agr 1708.01 Applications",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Agr 1708.01 Applications. Each applicant for a license shall apply using a form prescribed by and available from the department. The licensing application process shall be completed within 6 months of the department’s initial receipt of any required information, with exception for extraordinary circumstances, for example, accident, illness, or military service.\n\nSource. #10834, eff 5-21-15; ss by #14164, eff 12-31-24 (formerly Agr 1707.01)",
